{"uid":"22890b519e52b08","name":"test_table_cells_never_use_overflow_wrap_anywhere","fullName":"tests.test_docs_layout_contract#test_table_cells_never_use_overflow_wrap_anywhere","historyId":"70892e402e178e46ffb4db350ed90e65","time":{"start":1789734694007,"stop":1789734694011,"duration":4},"description":"``anywhere`` and ``break-word`` are not interchangeable inside a table.\n\n    ``overflow-wrap: anywhere`` *reduces* an element's min-content width, and auto\n    table layout sizes columns from exactly that — so applying it to a cell lets\n    the browser shrink a column below its longest word and stack that word one\n    character per line. Measured before this was fixed: a six-column table whose\n    true min-content width was 1034px rendered at 778px, and a cookbook label\n    ``Instructions`` rendered in a 32px column, 43 lines tall.\n\n    ``break-word`` still rescues a genuinely unbreakable token from overflowing,\n    without licensing the collapse. This test reads the stylesheet rather than the\n    rendered page so it costs nothing and runs everywhere; the rendered behaviour\n    was verified separately with a headless browser.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p><code>anywhere</code> and <code>break-word</code> are not interchangeable inside a table.</p>\n<pre><code>``overflow-wrap: anywhere`` *reduces* an element's min-content width, and auto\ntable layout sizes columns from exactly that — so applying it to a cell lets\nthe browser shrink a column below its longest word and stack that word one\ncharacter per line. Measured before this was fixed: a six-column table whose\ntrue min-content width was 1034px rendered at 778px, and a cookbook label\n``Instructions`` rendered in a 32px column, 43 lines tall.\n\n``break-word`` still rescues a genuinely unbreakable token from overflowing,\nwithout licensing the collapse. This test reads the stylesheet rather than the\nrendered page so it costs nothing and runs everywhere; the rendered behaviour\nwas verified separately with a headless browser.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789734219107,"stop":1789734219108,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1789734694003,"stop":1789734694003,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1789734694003,"stop":1789734694003,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_dispose_create_app_engines","time":{"start":1789734694004,"stop":1789734694004,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_tracer_singleton","time":{"start":1789734694004,"stop":1789734694005,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_default_tests_to_trusted_header_auth","time":{"start":1789734694004,"stop":1789734694004,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_pricing_source","time":{"start":1789734694004,"stop":1789734694004,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"steps